<body>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/symmetry.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>

<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 30 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">Symmetry</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">軸Symmetry · 鏡像 · Symmetry軸可以係斜嘅 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下D冊 單元一<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 <b>Symmetry軸一定係垂直線？錯！Symmetry軸可以係斜嘅！</b><br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 呈分試幾何題基礎，P5-P6常出Symmetry圖形辨識<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>P3 基本圖形認識 · 鏡像概念 · Square/Rectangle特性<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 認識軸Symmetry ❷ 找出Symmetry軸 ❸ 完成Symmetry圖形 ❹ 分辨Symmetry軸方向
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>照鏡時，你舉起左手，鏡入面嘅你會舉起邊隻手？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:38px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>以下邊啲英文字母有Symmetry軸？A · B · C · D · E · M · T</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>Square有幾多條Symmetry軸？畫出嚟。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>Rectangle有幾多條Symmetry軸？（提示：唔係4條！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>等邊Triangle有幾多條Symmetry軸？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：什麼是軸Symmetry？ <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>軸Symmetry：</b>一個圖形沿一條直線對摺後，兩邊<b>完全重疊</b><br/>
      ② <b>Symmetry軸 = 摺線：</b>Symmetry軸係一條想像中的線，圖形沿呢條線對摺後兩邊一模一樣<br/>
      ③ <b>鏡像效果：</b>Symmetry軸兩邊係對方的鏡像。距離Symmetry軸相同距離的點會對應<br/>
      ④ <b>重點：</b>Symmetry軸可以係垂直、水平、或<b>斜向</b>（45度都得！）
    </div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;">
<svg height="170" viewbox="0 0 500 170" width="500">
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="250" y="16">Symmetry軸的各種方向</text>
<!-- Vertical symmetry -->
<rect fill="#F0F9FF" height="125" rx="4" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" width="130" x="30" y="30"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="95" x2="95" y1="30" y2="155"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="95" y="170">垂直Symmetry軸</text>
<!-- Arrow shape -->
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="55,70 95,45 135,70 95,115" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon>
<!-- Horizontal symmetry -->
<rect fill="#F0FDF4" height="125" rx="4" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" width="130" x="185" y="30"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="185" x2="315" y1="92" y2="92"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="250" y="170">水平Symmetry軸</text>
<ellipse cx="250" cy="92" fill="#DCFCE7" rx="45" ry="30" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="1.5"></ellipse>
<!-- Diagonal symmetry -->
<rect fill="#FFFBEB" height="125" rx="4" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" width="130" x="340" y="30"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="350" x2="460" y1="40" y2="145"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="405" y="170">斜向Symmetry軸</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：常見圖形的Symmetry軸數量 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>Square：4 條</b>（垂直+水平+兩條對角線）<br/>
      ② <b>Rectangle：2 條</b>（垂直+水平）⚠️ 對角線唔係Symmetry軸！<br/>
      ③ <b>等邊Triangle：3 條</b>（每條從頂點到對邊中點）<br/>
      ④ <b>等腰Triangle：1 條</b>（從頂點到底邊中點）<br/>
      ⑤ <b>Circle形：無限多條</b>（任何穿過Circle心的直線都係Symmetry軸）<br/>
      ⑥ <b>Parallelogram（非Rhombus）：0 條！</b>
</div>
</div>
<div class="fig-row">
<div class="fig-card">
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 140 130" width="140">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="90" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="90" x="25" y="20"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="70" x2="70" y1="20" y2="110"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="25" x2="115" y1="65" y2="65"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="25" x2="115" y1="20" y2="110"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="115" x2="25" y1="20" y2="110"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="125">Square：4條</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="fig-card">
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 140 130" width="140">
<rect fill="#DCFCE7" height="70" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2.5" width="100" x="20" y="25"></rect>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="70" x2="70" y1="25" y2="95"></line>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="20" x2="120" y1="60" y2="60"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="110">Rectangle：2條</text>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="123">對角線唔係！</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="fig-card">
<svg height="130" viewbox="0 0 140 130" width="140">
<polygon fill="#FEF3C7" points="70,20 20,100 120,100" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2.5"></polygon>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="1.5" x1="70" x2="70" y1="20" y2="100"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="70" y="120">等腰Triangle：1條</text>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命Trap：Rectangle嘅對角線唔係Symmetry軸！沿對角線對摺，兩邊唔會完全重疊（因為長同闊唔同）。</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：完成Symmetry圖形 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>Step 1：</b>在方格紙上，找出Symmetry軸的位置<br/>
      ② <b>Step 2：</b>原有圖形的每個頂點，量度它到Symmetry軸的<b>垂直距離</b><br/>
      ③ <b>Step 3：</b>在Symmetry軸的另一邊，相同距離處標出對應點<br/>
      ④ <b>Step 4：</b>連接所有對應點，完成鏡像<br/>
      ⑤ <b>要訣：</b>數格！Symmetry軸左邊2格 → 右邊2格。Symmetry軸上邊3格 → 下邊3格
    </div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;">
<svg height="180" viewbox="0 0 320 180" width="320">
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="160" y="16">在方格紙上完成Symmetry圖形（Symmetry軸 = 紅色虛線）</text>
<!-- Grid -->
<rect fill="#FFF" height="130" stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.5" width="260" x="30" y="28"></rect>
<!-- Grid lines -->
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="30" x2="30" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="56" x2="56" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="82" x2="82" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="108" x2="108" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="134" x2="134" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="160" x2="160" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="186" x2="186" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="212" x2="212" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="238" x2="238" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="264" x2="264" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<line stroke="#D1D5DB" stroke-width="0.3" x1="290" x2="290" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<!-- Symmetry axis -->
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2.5" x1="160" x2="160" y1="28" y2="158"></line>
<!-- Half shape on left -->
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="82,54 82,132 134,132 134,80 108,54" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Symmetric half on right (lighter) -->
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" fill-opacity="0.4" points="238,54 186,54 186,80 160,80 160,132 186,132 238,132" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-dasharray="3,2" stroke-width="1"></polygon>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="160" y="175">左邊=原有·右邊=Symmetry（虛線=學生要畫）</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">在方格紙上，畫出以紅色虛線為Symmetry軸的Symmetry圖形。</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">以下哪條線是圖形的Symmetry軸？（給出選項，圖形=等腰Triangle）</div></div>
<div class="lf-game">
<div class="gtitle">🎮 遊戲：Symmetry摺紙王</div>
<div class="grule">每人攞張紙，對摺後剪一個形狀。打開！睇邊個嘅Symmetry圖形最靚！</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一至三 同步練習</div>
