<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>寫出以下圖形各有幾多條Symmetry軸：(a)Square (b)Rectangle (c)Circle形</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>等腰Triangle有1條Symmetry軸，呢條軸由邊度到邊度？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>在方格紙上，以垂直虛線為Symmetry軸，畫出一個Triangle的Symmetry圖形。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:62px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（All Must Complete，共 3 題）</div>
